Daemon: You built something. I am horrified, but we continue.
Daemon: [b][color=gold]Right click[/color][/b] switches to salvage mode.
Daemon: Then [b][color=gold]left click[/color][/b] your building to tear it down and recover materials.
Daemon: Not the generator. That one matters, unlike most of your decisions.
